--
The loop repeats the line of pthread_create, and the witness writer merged
steps on a repeated line or instruction: one createThread edge, while thread 2
ran too (41_FreeBSD_abd_kbd_sliced). The trace also creates threads up to the
loop bound that never run; their creation is left out, and unroll-bound is 2
(one iteration needed), not 5: Dartagnan confirmed FreeBSD in 4 s at 2 and
timed out at 3.
